---
layout: layouts/app.njk
title: Records
description: Each child's lessons, mastery tests, the skills where errors cluster, a chart of which facts are firm, and notes. All records stay in this browser.
permalink: /records/
bodyClass: page-records
---
<header class="screen__head">
  <h1 class="screen__title">Records</h1>
  <p class="screen__lead">Each child's results, kept only in this browser.</p>
</header>
<div id="profile-selector"></div>
<div id="dash"></div>
<section class="records-actions">
  <h2 class="section-title">Backups</h2>
  <p class="muted small">Records live in this browser only. Save a backup now and then, and load it on another device to carry records over. Clearing the browser's site data erases them.</p>
  <div class="btn-row">
    <button class="btn btn--secondary" id="btn-export-progress" type="button">Save a backup</button>
    <button class="btn btn--secondary" id="btn-import-progress" type="button">Load a backup</button>
    <button class="btn btn--danger" id="btn-reset-progress" type="button">Erase this child's records</button>
    <input type="file" id="import-progress-input" accept=".json" hidden aria-label="Backup file">
  </div>
</section>
<script id="dash-data" type="application/json">{{ program.summary | dump | safe }}</script>
<script src="/assets/js/progress.js?v={{ build.version }}"></script>
<script src="/assets/js/records.js?v={{ build.version }}" defer></script>
